    "message": "Test the resource config rule of v6 on a world with no service under way\n\nA world where someone is served water or a meal reads the config and is\nturned down without the rule, so the tests did not see it dropped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
