    "message": "Write the L7b lane doc and correct the v5 classification\n\nWorldState v5 is the world of a Scenario without resource_service, not an\nold saved shape. The inventory's two O sites in tick_validation.rs are C;\nstep4-plan.md, step4-refusal-sites.md and the L7, L9 and M5 lane docs say\nso, and docs/rust-port/lanes/l7b-world-v5.md records what differs between\nv5 and v6 for validation and the measurements.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
